東南亞戲院總有人願意排隊。幸好今天我晚了一點來，人潮鬆些，吃麵也就從容。\n\n吃到一半，店長還贈送一小碗炙燒叉燒飯。炙燒的香氣，遇上日式美乃滋，倒有點畫龍點睛的意思。\n\n唯一後悔的是，竟沒有空著肚子來。像這樣的一碗麵，本該留更多胃口給它。\n\n這家麵的味道，像一個舊識。彼此也不必多說什麼，各自做著手邊的事，像是這樣的相遇，本來就不必特別交代。入口沒有驚天動地，只是慢慢回想起來，愈吃愈覺得熟悉。",null,[0,22]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/12286942624022503511/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnh3VjFZeGNIUmtNVGw1WVZkS2NtVnRXWFJaTWpFd1UwYzFabGx0WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12286942624022503511/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnh3VjFZeGNIUmtNVGw1WVZkS2NtVnRXWFJaTWpFd1UwYzFabGx0WXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/12286942624022503511/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnh3VjFZeGNIUmtNVGw1WVZkS2NtVnRXWFJaTWpFd1UwYzFabGx0WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12286942624022503511/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnh3VjFZeGNIUmtNVGw1WVZkS2NtVnRXWFJaTWpFd1UwYzFabGx0WXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/12286942624022503511/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnh3VjFZeGNIUmtNVGw1WVZkS2NtVnRXWFJaTWpFd1UwYzFabGx0WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12286942624022503511/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnh3VjFZeGNIUmtNVGw1WVZkS2NtVnRXWFJaTWpFd1UwYzFabGx0WXhBQhAA"]],[null,null,991,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xwV1YxcHRkMTl5YVdKcmVtWXRZMjEwU0c1ZlltYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xdb52b7a7d5318149!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOlpWV1ptd19yaWJremYtY210SG5fYmc%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xwV1YxcHRkMTl5YVdKcmVtWXRZMjEwU0c1ZlltYxAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xwV1YxcHRkMTl5YVdKcmVtWXRZMjEwU0c1ZlltYxI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xwV1YxcHRkMTl5YVdKcmVtWXRZMjEwU0c1ZlltYxILMGVRYVE4cUZaSFQaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b0